WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.742 line:78%
 .

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:10.377 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I STAND SQUARELY BEHIND MY

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.578 line:78%
DECISION.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:13.046 line:78%
AFTER 20 YEARS I HAVE LEARNED

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:14.814 line:78%
THE HARD WAY THAT THERE WAS

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:18.318 line:78%
NEVER A GOOD TIME TO WITHDRAW

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:20.653 line:78%
U.S. FORCES.

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:22.822 line:78%
HERE'S WHAT I BELIEVE TO MY CORE

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:26.426 line:78%
IT IS WRONG TO ORDER AMERICAN

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:27.394 line:78%
TROOPS TO STEP UP UP WHEN

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.827 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN'S OWN ARMED FORCES

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.829 line:78%
WOULD NOT.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:31.698 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE INCOMPETENCE OF THE BIDEN

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.132 line:78%
ADMINISTRATION ON THIS IS REALLY

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.233 line:78%
OVERWHELMING.

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:35.301 line:78%
THERE NEEDS TO BE RESIGNATIONS.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.903 line:78%
THERE NEEDS TO BE FIRINGS.

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.038 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THIS MAKES ALL OF US ANGRY

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:38.405 line:78%
BECAUSE IT WAS COMPLETELY

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:39.572 line:78%
AVOIDABLE.

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:41.374 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WHAT HAPPENS IN AFGHANISTAN

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.775 line:78%
DOESN'T JUST STAY IN

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:44.811 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:45.545 line:78%
IT SPREADS LIKE A CANCER.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.713 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: PRESIDENT BIDEN'S

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:48.081 line:78%
SPEAKING TODAY AND CAN YOU SEE

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:49.682 line:78%
THE FEAR, OBVIOUSLY, IN THE

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:51.484 line:78%
PEOPLE RUNNING AWAY FROM THOSE

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:53.620 line:78%
PLANES AT THE KABUL AIRPORT.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:55.922 line:78%
YOU CAN ALSO SEE IT ON THE FACE

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:57.257 line:78%
AND IN THE VOICE OF ONE OF THE

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:59.859 line:78%
REPORTERS IN THE PENTAGON

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:02.028 line:78%
BRIEFING TODAY, A REPORTER, AN

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:05.665 line:78%
AFGHAN WOMAN WHO HAS BEEN

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:06.566 line:78%
COVERING THE PENTAGON BUT GO

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:08.968 line:78%
BACK TO AFGHANISTAN.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:15.175 line:78%
TAKE A LISTEN.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:16.843 line:78%
&gt;&gt; EXPECT OVERNIGHT ALL THE

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.177 line:78%
TALIBAN' [INAUDIBLE] THIS IS MY

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.379 line:78%
FLAG.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:22.182 line:78%
THEY PUT THEIR FLAG.

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:22.916 line:78%
WHERE IS MY PRESIDENT FORMER

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.051 line:78%
PRESIDENT BEGANY.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:26.686 line:78%
HE HAS TO FIGHT FOR HIS PEOPLE.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:28.621 line:78%
I HAVE LOTS OF ACHIEVEMENT.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.122 line:78%
I LEFT FROM THE TALIBAN LIKE 20

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:34.327 line:78%
YEARS AGO.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:35.295 line:78%
NOW WE GO BACK TO THE FIRST --

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.397 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: AFGHANISTAN'S PRESIDENT

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:40.567 line:78%
ASHRAF GHANI LEFT THE COUNTRY

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:43.236 line:78%
JUST TO PUT A COST ON WHAT THE

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:48.208 line:78%
U.S. HAS SPENT IN THE TOTAL COST

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:49.809 line:78%
OF THE WAR, $978 BILLION FROM

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:51.578 line:78%
2001 TO 2020.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:53.746 line:78%
NOT INCLUDING, OBVIOUSLY, THE

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:55.381 line:78%
BLOOD AND TREASURE LEFT THERE.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:57.917 line:78%
LET'S BRING IN OUR PANEL SENIOR

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:59.319 line:78%
POLITICAL ANALYST BRIT HUME, BEN

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.953 line:78%
DOMENECH, PUBLISHER OF THE

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.321 line:78%
FEDERALIST.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:03.356 line:78%
HAROLD FORD JR. FORMER TENNESSEE

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:04.991 line:78%
CONGRESSMAN AND COE OF

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:09.262 line:78%
EMPOWERMENT AND ENCOLLUSION

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:11.264 line:78%
CAPITAL AND TREY GOWDY FORMER

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:12.465 line:78%
CONGRESSMAN FROM SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:12.732 line:78%
THE PRESIDENT'S SPEECH ON THIS

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:13.867 line:78%
DAY?

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.835 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE PRESIDENT'S SPEECH

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.571 line:78%
WAS ABOUT THE ONE THING THAT HE

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:20.773 line:78%
KNOWS IS STILL POPULAR AND THAT

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:21.174 line:78%
IS THE IDEA OF GETTING OUT OF

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:23.510 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:25.044 line:78%
BUT, FOR MUCH OF THE SPEECH I

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.912 line:78%
DIDN'T FIGURE OUT WHAT WAR --

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.446 line:78%
WHAT SO-CALLED WAR HE WAS

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.148 line:78%
TALKING ABOUT.

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:30.283 line:78%
WE HAVE BEEN GETTING OUT OF

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:30.917 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN GRADUALLY SLOWLY FOR

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:32.685 line:78%
YEARS AND YEARS.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:35.488 line:78%
WE WERE DOWN NOW IN THAT COUNTRY

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.422 line:78%
TO ABOUT 2500 AMERICAN SOLDIERS

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.423 line:78%
ON THE GROUND.

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:38.625 line:78%
NO AMERICAN SOLDIER HAD BEEN

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:39.058 line:78%
KILLED THERE IN A YEAR AND A

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:41.895 line:78%
HALF.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:43.763 line:78%
BUT THAT LITTLE MODEST FORCE

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:45.765 line:78%
WITH THE AIR POWER, THE

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.599 line:78%
INTELLIGENCE AND LOGISTICAL

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:48.468 line:78%
SUPPORT AND ADVICE THAT CAME

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:50.870 line:78%
WITH IT, WAS ENOUGH TO MAINTAIN

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.638 line:78%
KIND OF AN UNEASY STALEMATE IN

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.872 line:78%
THAT COUNTRY.

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:54.374 line:78%
THE PRESIDENT COMES ALONG AND

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.575 line:78%
BLOWS THE WHOLE THING UP BECAUSE

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:57.243 line:78%
HE WANTS TO GET OUT.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:59.445 line:78%
WE WERE GETTING OUT.

00:02:57.343 --> 00:03:00.480 line:78%
AND IT MATTERED HOW WE GOT OUT.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.148 line:78%
IT ALWAYS MATTERS HOW YOU GET

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.584 line:78%
OUT IN A SITUATION LIKE THIS

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:06.586 line:78%
WITH DRAWLS AND EVACUATIONS ARE

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.953 line:78%
VERY MILITARILY TRICKY AND

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:09.756 line:78%
DANGEROUS.

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:10.823 line:78%
AND THIS ONE HAS BEEN UTTERLY

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:12.592 line:78%
AND COMPLETELY BOTCHED.

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:14.694 line:78%
APART FROM SAYING THEY DIDN'T

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:15.595 line:78%
EXPECT IT TO GO DOWN HERE THIS

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.829 line:78%
FAST, THE PRESIDENT DID NOTHING

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:19.532 line:78%
TO EXPLAIN HOW THAT HAPPENED OR

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:37.283 line:78%
WHY IT HAS GONE SO BADLY.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:39.352 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: TREY GOWDY?

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:41.321 line:78%
I KEEP THINKING OF THE WORD OF

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:43.089 line:78%
ROBERT GATES NOT THE REPUBLICAN

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:43.790 line:78%
CONGRESSMAN WE JUST PLAYED BUT

00:03:43.189 --> 00:03:45.491 line:78%
OBAMA'S FORMER SECRETARY OF

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:48.728 line:78%
DEFENSE WHO SAID JOE BIDEN FOR

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:51.264 line:78%
FOUR DECADES WAS WRONG ON NEARLY

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:52.832 line:78%
EVERY MAJOR FOREIGN POLICY AND

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:54.767 line:78%
NATIONAL SECURITY DECISION

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:56.102 line:78%
THAT'S ROBERT GATES SAYING THAT

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:58.338 line:78%
FOUR DECADES WORTH.

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:59.706 line:78%
I'M HAPPY HE KEPT A CAMPAIGN

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:01.007 line:78%
PROMISE BECAUSE HE SEEMS REALLY

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:03.676 line:78%
REALLY INTERESTED IN DOING THAT

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:05.044 line:78%
I'M JUST SORRY FOR Y'ALL THE

00:04:03.776 --> 00:04:05.311 line:78%
CARNAGE LEFT BEHIND BECAUSE HE

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:06.145 line:78%
DID.

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:08.214 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: IT HAS BEEN INTERESTING

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:10.183 line:78%
TO WATCH THE EVOLUTION OF THE

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:11.017 line:78%
WEEK AND HOW THIS TRANSPIRED

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:15.888 line:78%
VERY QUICKLY.

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:17.757 line:78%
TAKE A LISTEN.

00:04:15.989 --> 00:04:19.759 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS NOT JUST ABOUT THE

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:20.159 line:78%
OVERALL IDEA OF LEAVING

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:22.362 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.596 line:78%
THIS IS ABOUT LEAVING HASTILY

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:25.365 line:78%
AND INEPTLY.

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:26.432 line:78%
SECRETARY BLINKEN, HOW DID

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:26.733 line:78%
PRESIDENT BIDEN GET THIS SO

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:30.637 line:78%
WRONG?

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:31.204 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SO, WAS HE MISLEAD BY HIS OWN

00:04:30.737 --> 00:04:33.773 line:78%
INTELLIGENCE AGENCIES?

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:35.441 line:78%
DID HE NOT LISTEN TO THEM?

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:37.610 line:78%
WHY WAS HE SO WRONG ABOUT THAT?

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:39.045 line:78%
&gt;&gt; MR. BIDEN, WHO HASN'T BEEN

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.880 line:78%
SHY ABOUT CHANGING ALL SORTS OF

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:42.749 line:78%
OTHER POLICIES HE INHERITED FROM

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:44.384 line:78%
IRAN TO CLIMATE CHANGE, WHY WAS

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:44.717 line:78%
HE UNWILLING TO CHANGE THIS

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:46.686 line:78%
POLICY?

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:48.221 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THERE HAS BEEN AN IMPLOSION

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:49.422 line:78%
OF U.S. POLICY, AND I THINK

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:51.157 line:78%
SOMEONE GETS FIRED FOR THIS.

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:52.058 line:78%
IN MY OPINION IT WOULD BE

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:53.159 line:78%
SECRETARY BLINKEN.

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:53.459 line:78%
THIS IS NOT THE MILITARY'S

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:54.594 line:78%
FAULT.

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:57.630 line:78%
THIS IS AN INTELLIGENCE FAILURE

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:59.132 line:78%
HERE IN WASHINGTON.

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.499 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: HAROLD, REACTION TO ALL

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:01.234 line:78%
OF THAT?

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:02.535 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WELL, FIRST OFF, THANKS FOR

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:06.372 line:78%
HAVING ME.

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:09.142 line:78%
LOOK, I THINK, BRIT AND TREY ARE

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:10.877 line:78%
ABOUT RIGHT IN THIS SENSE.

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:12.178 line:78%
PRESIDENT BIDEN DECLARED TO THE

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:13.346 line:78%
COUNTRY THREE OUT OF FOUR

00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:15.248 line:78%
AMERICANS AGREE WITH HIM THAT

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:16.115 line:78%
AMERICA SHOULD NOT BE IN

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:17.450 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN ANY LONGER.

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:19.519 line:78%
THERE IS NO DOUBT.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:21.821 line:78%
WE ACCOMPLISHED A LOT OF WHAT WE

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:24.991 line:78%
INTENDED TO ACCOMPLISH.

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:27.794 line:78%
I WAS IN CONGRESS 9/11.

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:28.961 line:78%
WE BELIEVED THAT JIHADISTS AND

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:29.362 line:78%
AL-QAEDA WERE OPERATING FROM

00:05:29.062 --> 00:05:33.666 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:34.667 line:78%
WE SENT FORCES THERE TO KILL BIN

00:05:33.766 --> 00:05:37.503 line:78%
LADEN AND WE DID.

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:38.671 line:78%
ANY TIME YOU PROJECT MILITARY --

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:39.572 line:78%
AMERICAN MILITARY INTO

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:41.841 line:78%
ENGAGEMENT WITH A CLEAR

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:43.076 line:78%
OBJECTIVE OR A DESIRED OUTCOME,

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:43.643 line:78%
THEY GENERALLY DO VERY, VERY

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:45.812 line:78%
WELL.

00:05:43.743 --> 00:05:47.246 line:78%
BUT, YOU INVITE TROUBLE AND YOU

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:50.249 line:78%
INVITE DISAPPOINTMENT, YOU

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:51.851 line:78%
INVITE UNDESIRED OUTCOMES WHEN

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.318 line:78%
THE DEFINED PURPOSE IS NOT SO

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.486 line:78%
DEFINED.

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:53.853 line:78%
OVER THE LAST SEVERAL YEARS, IT

00:05:53.586 --> 00:05:55.021 line:78%
WAS NOT.

00:05:54.053 --> 00:05:56.756 line:78%
HE HAD THAT RIGHT.

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:57.457 line:78%
BUT, WITHOUT QUESTION, HE, BEING

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:58.624 line:78%
PRESIDENT BIDEN.

00:05:57.557 --> 00:06:00.159 line:78%
BUT, WITHOUT QUESTION, THEY HAVE

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:01.594 line:78%
BOTCHED THIS EXIT.

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:03.329 line:78%
THIS NATIONAL SECURITY TEAM OF

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:06.399 line:78%
HIS, THE PRESSURE IS MOUNTING IN

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:08.468 line:78%
MANY, MANY WAYS FOR THEM TO FIX

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:09.569 line:78%
THIS EXIT PLAN FOR ALL OF OUR

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:11.104 line:78%
AFGHAN ALLIES.

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:12.305 line:78%
I WOULD HOPE THOSE OF US WHO

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:12.672 line:78%
WISH TO BE CRITICAL OF THE

00:06:12.405 --> 00:06:14.574 line:78%
PRESIDENT.

00:06:12.772 --> 00:06:14.841 line:78%
I DON'T WISH TO BE CRITICAL OF

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:16.442 line:78%
HIM.

00:06:14.941 --> 00:06:18.111 line:78%
BUT WISH TO BE CRITICAL OF HIM

00:06:16.676 --> 00:06:19.112 line:78%
PLEASE DO NOT CONFLATE THE TWO.

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:19.912 line:78%
THE EXIT FROM AFGHANISTAN IS THE

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:21.414 line:78%
RIGHT THING TO DO.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.048 line:78%
WE HAVE OTHER PRIORITIES WE NEED

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:24.350 line:78%
TO FOCUS ON.

00:06:22.148 --> 00:06:26.252 line:78%
AND IF BY SOME CHANCE

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:32.558 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN BECOMES A WOODSTOCK

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:34.093 line:78%
FOR JIHADISTS WE WILL BE ABLE TO

00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:35.261 line:78%
COALITION WILLING MORE RESOLUTE

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:36.262 line:78%
ONE UNDER PRESIDENT BUSH IF THAT

00:06:35.361 --> 00:06:38.164 line:78%
IS INDEED THE CASE.

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:40.733 line:78%
BUT THEY HAVE TO FIX THIS EXIT

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:42.835 line:78%
PLAN.  THIS WILL BE PRESIDENT

00:06:40.867 --> 00:06:43.102 line:78%
BIDEN'S ACHILLES HEEL IF HE DOES

00:06:42.935 --> 00:06:43.903 line:78%
NOT.

00:06:43.269 --> 00:06:45.238 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU KNOW, WE DIDN'T

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:46.372 line:78%
HEAR ABOUT THE RULES OF

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:47.774 line:78%
ENGAGEMENT FOR THOSE TROOPS

00:06:46.472 --> 00:06:48.107 line:78%
TRYING TO GET ALL THOSE PEOPLE

00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:49.642 line:78%
OUT.

00:06:48.274 --> 00:06:51.511 line:78%
WE DIDN'T HEAR HOW LONG THE AIR

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:52.445 line:78%
BRIDGE REALLY IS GOING TO RUN IN

00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:54.547 line:78%
THE PRESIDENT'S SPEECH.

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:56.582 line:78%
AND JUST IN THE PAST FEW

00:06:54.647 --> 00:06:58.384 line:78%
MINUTES, BEN, ASSOCIATED PRESS,

00:06:56.749 --> 00:07:00.353 line:78%
U.S. DEFENSE OFFICIAL CONFIRMS

00:06:58.484 --> 00:07:02.321 line:78%
TALIBAN'S SUDDEN ACCUMULATION OF

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:05.892 line:78%
U.S. SUPPLIED AFGHAN EQUIPMENT

00:07:03.423 --> 00:07:08.060 line:78%
IS, QUOTE:  ENORMOUS.

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:08.961 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, THIS IS A TRAVESTY

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:11.497 line:78%
IN SO MANY WAYS.

00:07:09.128 --> 00:07:12.932 line:78%
AND I DO THINK THAT WE HAVE TO

00:07:11.731 --> 00:07:14.000 line:78%
SEPARATE THE POLICY HERE FROM

00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:15.668 line:78%
THE EXECUTION.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.437 line:78%
THE POLICY IS BROADLY POPULAR.

00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:19.839 line:78%
AND I HEARD THE PRESIDENT COME

00:07:17.537 --> 00:07:20.940 line:78%
OUT AND DEFEND THE POLICY OF

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:22.608 line:78%
LEAVING AFGHANISTAN.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.643 line:78%
BUT IT'S A SPEECH THAT HE COULD

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:25.311 line:78%
HAVE GIVEN SIX MONTHS AGO.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.612 line:78%
AND IT REALLY DIDN'T WRESTLE

00:07:25.411 --> 00:07:27.580 line:78%
WITH ANY OF THE ACTUAL QUESTIONS

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:29.248 line:78%
THAT PEOPLE HAVE OVER WHAT THEY

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:30.116 line:78%
HAVE SEEN OVER THE PAST SEVERAL

